# Priority Board

A Kanban-style dashboard that answers "what should I work on next?" without
anyone needing to ask a manager.

![Priority board screenshot](docs/screenshot.png)

## Features
- Rank-ordered epic swimlanes
- Quick filters: My next pickup, Up for grabs, At risk
- Shipped-this-week tracker
- Decisions-needed panel
- Per-epic progress bars

Built with CLAUDE code. Mock data included — no backend required.
